        "bodyHtml": "Nautilus fires a shockwave that chases an enemy champion, dealing <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(150/275/400 + ([[si:scaleap]]80% Ability Power)) magic damage</span>, <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Knocking</span> them <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Up</span> and <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Stunning</span> them for 1/1.5/2 seconds. Other enemies hit by the shockwave are also <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Knocked Up</span> and <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Stunned</span> and take <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(125/175/225 + ([[si:scaleap]]40% Ability Power)) magic damage</span>.",
